1
00:00:20,645 --> 00:00:22,814
He is currently in a sleep state.

2
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:29,779
He wakes up sitting up cross-legged,

3
00:00:29,863 --> 00:00:34,576
stays awake for a few hours,
then falls asleep for another 24 hours.

4
00:00:34,659 --> 00:00:35,994
It's all understandable.

5
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:38,496
His entire memory is gone, after all.

6
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:41,708
How is he retaining new information
since getting resuscitated?

7
00:00:41,791 --> 00:00:42,709
It's normal.

8
00:00:43,293 --> 00:00:45,712
He has learned about
30 English words so far.

9
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:50,842
However,
he does not comprehend his identity.

10
00:00:52,802 --> 00:00:53,887
Even his family…

11
00:00:54,971 --> 00:00:58,391
He doesn't show any response,
even to his daughter's photos.

12
00:01:02,854 --> 00:01:05,774
His brain waves and EKG are
within normal parameters.

13
00:01:05,857 --> 00:01:09,319
But his muscle mass has decreased.

14
00:01:09,402 --> 00:01:16,242
With all his memories gone,
he does not feel any reason to live,

15
00:01:16,826 --> 00:01:20,413
causing the body to rapidly atrophy.

16
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,875
What can we do, Doctor?

17
00:01:24,876 --> 00:01:26,169
I cannot say.

18
00:01:26,252 --> 00:01:30,632
His only chance of recovery might be
retrieving his memory.

19
00:01:32,342 --> 00:01:34,636
Doctor, do not touch his head!

20
00:01:38,765 --> 00:01:39,933
He got hurt!

21
00:01:40,016 --> 00:01:40,850
We must treat him!

22
00:01:40,934 --> 00:01:45,104
I'm sorry, Doctor. I forgot to warn you.

23
00:01:45,188 --> 00:01:47,190
Did he use his Stand just now?

24
00:01:47,273 --> 00:01:50,610
He did. However,
that wasn't from his consciousness.

25
00:01:50,693 --> 00:01:53,488
It was just his instinctive bodily reflex
to defend.

26
00:01:57,117 --> 00:01:59,702
"Jo… Lyne."

27
00:01:59,786 --> 00:02:00,870
"Jolyne"?

28
00:02:01,746 --> 00:02:05,875
No… that's not possible.

29
00:02:15,009 --> 00:02:16,553
I've always…

30
00:02:18,138 --> 00:02:22,475
I've always cared about you.

31
00:02:25,061 --> 00:02:27,397
Something's going on with your cut.

32
00:02:27,981 --> 00:02:32,235
It was fixed. I know I just filled it in.

33
00:02:33,361 --> 00:02:36,948
It looks like some sort of writing,
doesn't it?

34
00:02:37,615 --> 00:02:39,242
Should I try to fill it again?

35
00:02:39,325 --> 00:02:40,493
Wait.

36
00:02:41,202 --> 00:02:42,787
Don't fill this one.

37
00:02:45,290 --> 00:02:47,542
I can't explain it, but…

38
00:02:47,625 --> 00:02:48,918
I just know it.

39
00:02:49,502 --> 00:02:52,589
This is a message from my father.

40
00:02:54,257 --> 00:02:58,845
He's had so much to protect
even before I was born.

41
00:02:59,470 --> 00:03:04,350
He was always away to keep dangers
like the one I'm in now

42
00:03:04,434 --> 00:03:07,729
away from me and Mom.

43
00:03:10,023 --> 00:03:12,358
I felt it, just now.

44
00:03:12,442 --> 00:03:16,529
 My body tells me that
I understand my father now.

45
00:04:49,747 --> 00:04:52,000
EPISODE 19: BIRTH OF THE "GREEN"

46
00:04:52,083 --> 00:04:54,377
- Hey F.F.
- What?

47
00:04:54,460 --> 00:04:57,964
Can you trip Jolyne down the stairs?

48
00:04:58,047 --> 00:05:00,508
Just a little bit will do.

49
00:05:01,968 --> 00:05:03,344
Why would I do that?

50
00:05:03,428 --> 00:05:06,389
I said, try to trip her.

51
00:05:07,015 --> 00:05:09,767
We won't let her get hurt, of course.

52
00:05:09,851 --> 00:05:13,730
I want to catch her from falling
with my own arms.

53
00:05:13,813 --> 00:05:15,023
What?

54
00:05:16,024 --> 00:05:20,778
Jolyne doesn't seem like
she understood that I saved her.

55
00:05:21,446 --> 00:05:25,325
I want to embrace her tightly
one more time.

56
00:05:25,408 --> 00:05:27,535
Now, get to it.

57
00:05:27,618 --> 00:05:30,163
- Trip her.
- Why don't you do it?

58
00:05:30,246 --> 00:05:31,414
That's sexual harassment.

59
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:35,251
I already told you.
I'm going to marry Jolyne.

60
00:05:35,335 --> 00:05:40,506
And you promised to cooperate.
Or do you not keep your word?

61
00:05:44,385 --> 00:05:45,219
Now, go do it.

62
00:05:49,140 --> 00:05:51,184
I'm sorry, Jolyne.

63
00:05:54,687 --> 00:05:56,105
The small man!

64
00:05:56,189 --> 00:05:57,315
He's right here!

65
00:05:57,398 --> 00:05:59,776
He was spying on us from above!

66
00:06:02,028 --> 00:06:04,781
Look! He has the bone in his hand!

67
00:06:14,499 --> 00:06:19,295
This fucker sure moves in a funny way,
but he won't get away!

68
00:06:19,378 --> 00:06:20,421
Hold it!

69
00:06:21,631 --> 00:06:23,299
Do you see his back contorting?

70
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:31,349
You called him a small man.

71
00:06:31,432 --> 00:06:33,893
It's true he fit the description earlier.

72
00:06:33,976 --> 00:06:37,647
- But something strange is happening…
- Sunbathing…

73
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:39,732
Isn't he growing taller?

74
00:06:40,358 --> 00:06:43,861
He's as tall as me,
no, he's taller than me now.

75
00:06:43,945 --> 00:06:46,572
You have nowhere to run.

76
00:06:46,656 --> 00:06:48,825
Turn around slowly.

77
00:06:49,450 --> 00:06:51,744
The sunlight is nice and warm.

78
00:06:51,828 --> 00:06:52,912
Light is good.

79
00:06:52,995 --> 00:06:56,040
I said turn around, you little shit!

80
00:06:58,543 --> 00:06:59,502
Bleh…

81
00:07:01,295 --> 00:07:02,296
Bleh.

82
00:07:09,512 --> 00:07:11,848
What the fuck is with him?

83
00:07:11,931 --> 00:07:16,018
Light, bleh, warm.

84
00:07:16,644 --> 00:07:20,314
We are happy… as we gather around…

85
00:07:20,398 --> 00:07:21,858
and it's warm.

86
00:07:22,358 --> 00:07:23,317
Bleh.

87
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:30,741
What was that?

88
00:07:30,825 --> 00:07:34,704
Did you see that stuff splatter?
He could be a Stand User!

89
00:07:34,787 --> 00:07:36,205
Keep your distance.

90
00:07:36,289 --> 00:07:37,665
It doesn't seem to be a Stand.

91
00:07:38,207 --> 00:07:41,544
I don't know what it is,
but we mustn't touch him.

92
00:07:42,128 --> 00:07:43,588
Where's the bone?

93
00:07:43,671 --> 00:07:47,258
The bone he had earlier. Where is it now?

94
00:08:03,316 --> 00:08:04,400
What the…

95
00:08:04,484 --> 00:08:08,988
The other prisoners
have already fallen prey.

96
00:08:09,071 --> 00:08:13,493
Those look like plants.
They're still growing.

97
00:08:14,076 --> 00:08:17,455
What happened to them, and who did this?

98
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:20,791
What is the meaning of this?

99
00:08:23,669 --> 00:08:27,924
Should I assume that it's a Stand ability?

100
00:08:28,424 --> 00:08:29,592
This bone,

101
00:08:30,343 --> 00:08:34,263
along with the power and some sort of will
that sprouted these plants…

102
00:08:34,347 --> 00:08:37,266
It's as if they are trying to
give birth to something.

103
00:08:37,767 --> 00:08:42,939
It bloomed the flowers first,
then the plants matured.

104
00:08:43,022 --> 00:08:44,899
They grew out at
the end of the person's life.

105
00:08:44,982 --> 00:08:51,405
Now, what to do with this bone
that the man dropped…

106
00:08:51,906 --> 00:08:56,869
Merely touching this bone
or anyone who grabbed it

107
00:08:56,953 --> 00:08:58,538
can be dangerous, after all.

108
00:09:00,498 --> 00:09:02,917
Don't take another step, Jolyne Cujoh!

109
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,961
Stop right there!

110
00:09:09,465 --> 00:09:10,967
Show me your face.

111
00:09:11,551 --> 00:09:13,177
Turn around.

112
00:09:18,683 --> 00:09:20,518
- What?
- It's nothing.

113
00:09:20,601 --> 00:09:23,312
I want to take a moment to
check something.

114
00:09:31,445 --> 00:09:34,407
What the hell is wrong with you?

115
00:09:34,490 --> 00:09:36,242
Let go of her, asshole!

116
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:38,703
F.F., you stay silent.

117
00:09:38,786 --> 00:09:43,124
The bone transformed the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into that state.

118
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,001
It can't be an enemy Stand,

119
00:09:45,084 --> 00:09:48,671
since that would have
targeted us from the start.

120
00:09:48,754 --> 00:09:51,340
And if I'm not mistaken, Jolyne,

121
00:09:51,424 --> 00:09:57,305
I think I saw your thread touching
that bone when it was still in his grasp.

122
00:10:09,817 --> 00:10:11,736
The bone! It's rolling away!

123
00:10:15,072 --> 00:10:17,241
She's infected!

124
00:10:17,325 --> 00:10:18,868
Jolyne!

125
00:10:20,161 --> 00:10:21,495
But how?

126
00:10:24,165 --> 00:10:25,875
Diver Drive!

127
00:10:27,668 --> 00:10:28,794
Yes!

128
00:10:28,878 --> 00:10:32,923
Weed them all out from the inside, quick!

129
00:10:33,924 --> 00:10:35,468
There's more!

130
00:10:35,551 --> 00:10:36,761
Why did you stop?

131
00:10:36,844 --> 00:10:41,140
I wouldn't exactly say they're growing out
of her or that they need to be rooted out.

132
00:10:41,223 --> 00:10:44,310
Rather, her body itself
is transforming into plants.

133
00:10:44,393 --> 00:10:47,021
Is it safe to pull them out?

134
00:10:47,104 --> 00:10:48,606
Jolyne, does it hurt?

135
00:10:50,566 --> 00:10:51,442
No.

136
00:10:51,525 --> 00:10:54,945
I guess I did touch that bone.

137
00:10:55,571 --> 00:10:59,283
Anyway, you should stay away from me
now that I'm infected.

138
00:10:59,909 --> 00:11:01,452
It might spread to you.

139
00:11:07,625 --> 00:11:11,420
These are just plants,
nothing more, nothing less.

140
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:14,006
I can't tell what species they are,

141
00:11:14,090 --> 00:11:17,760
but its stems are filled
with chlorophyll, not blood.

142
00:11:17,843 --> 00:11:22,390
Either way,
I'll take care of it. I promise.

143
00:11:33,359 --> 00:11:34,568
The sunlight!

144
00:11:34,652 --> 00:11:36,362
Get in the shade.

145
00:11:36,445 --> 00:11:38,739
If you touch sunlight
or move toward the light,

146
00:11:38,823 --> 00:11:40,491
the plants will grow rapidly.

147
00:11:40,574 --> 00:11:43,744
Step farther into the shade,
and the plants recede.

148
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:47,373
Damn, what does it want?

149
00:11:47,456 --> 00:11:52,128
I can't say,
but I still need to get that bone.

150
00:11:52,211 --> 00:11:53,712
And just how will you do that?

151
00:11:53,796 --> 00:11:57,508
If you hold the bone,
you'll turn into a plant, Jolyne!

152
00:11:58,092 --> 00:11:59,343
I will pick it up.

153
00:12:00,803 --> 00:12:02,263
I'm already becoming a plant.

154
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:09,186
Don't go where
the sunlight touches, Jolyne!

155
00:12:09,812 --> 00:12:12,273
The bone… Where is it?

156
00:12:13,274 --> 00:12:14,650
Where can it be?

157
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:18,487
I thought I saw it rolling
towards this flower.

158
00:12:21,031 --> 00:12:22,450
A star shape?

159
00:12:22,533 --> 00:12:25,161
What is this bruise-like mark?

160
00:12:25,995 --> 00:12:28,873
It's see-through.
There's something else underneath.

161
00:12:31,125 --> 00:12:32,543
A child…

162
00:12:33,961 --> 00:12:35,546
It's a green child!

163
00:12:42,219 --> 00:12:43,971
STAND NAME: YA-YA MA
STAND MASTER: D AN' G

164
00:12:44,513 --> 00:12:46,056
What is it shaped like?

165
00:12:47,433 --> 00:12:52,188
Carrots that look like Snoopy,
breast-shaped radishes, and other shapes

166
00:12:52,271 --> 00:12:54,398
are found all the time during harvests.

167
00:12:54,482 --> 00:12:56,567
This is just like those.

168
00:12:58,611 --> 00:13:00,362
It really just resembles a child.

169
00:13:03,574 --> 00:13:05,993
It's alive! Impossible!

170
00:13:06,076 --> 00:13:09,705
Jolyne, forget about it and come back!

171
00:13:09,788 --> 00:13:11,165
Haven't you noticed?

172
00:13:11,248 --> 00:13:14,376
Your legs are turning too.
They are attaching to the vines!

173
00:13:14,460 --> 00:13:20,299
What is this thing?
Is it a plant, or is it a human?

174
00:13:20,382 --> 00:13:22,426
It turned the prisoners
in the Disciplinary Wing into plants,

175
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:24,845
joined their roots, and became a fruit!

176
00:13:25,971 --> 00:13:30,226
The bone must have gotten
implanted inside this fruit.

177
00:13:30,309 --> 00:13:34,813
Pale Snake is at this prison
to discover what lies beyond this point.

178
00:13:35,397 --> 00:13:37,399
What will it spawn?

179
00:13:37,483 --> 00:13:40,945
He wants to know
what transpires when it is born.

180
00:13:41,028 --> 00:13:43,489
I told you to come back, Jolyne.

181
00:13:43,572 --> 00:13:47,284
The sun is moving westward,
causing more sunlight to enter.

182
00:13:47,368 --> 00:13:49,703
You must move further back.

183
00:13:51,455 --> 00:13:53,541
Are you taking that with you?

184
00:13:53,624 --> 00:13:57,253
We call this seizing by force, F.F.

185
00:13:58,045 --> 00:14:00,548
I will not let Pale Snake have it.

186
00:14:01,048 --> 00:14:02,591
Come, Jolyne.

187
00:14:02,675 --> 00:14:05,094
We must move opposite the sun's direction.

188
00:14:06,595 --> 00:14:07,888
Anastasia.

189
00:14:07,972 --> 00:14:10,516
This wing's entrance is to the west.

190
00:14:10,599 --> 00:14:13,143
We'll never leave this shitty place
if we go east.

191
00:14:13,227 --> 00:14:18,274
There's at least one other Stand User
somewhere in this wing.

192
00:14:23,070 --> 00:14:25,072
Escape, huh.

193
00:14:31,996 --> 00:14:34,582
Help me, please.

194
00:14:35,165 --> 00:14:37,334
Someone help!

195
00:14:37,418 --> 00:14:38,878
Please!

196
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:43,090
After everyone drowned, they turned
into plants and died! How horrible!

197
00:14:43,173 --> 00:14:44,717
I'm begging you!

198
00:14:44,800 --> 00:14:47,928
I don't want to turn into a plant!
Please, get me out of here!

199
00:14:48,012 --> 00:14:49,138
Fine.

200
00:14:49,722 --> 00:14:52,349
What's your name? Are you hurt?

201
00:14:53,058 --> 00:14:56,145
What are you saying, Anastasia?
He could be our enemy.

202
00:14:56,228 --> 00:14:59,607
Are they right? Are you against us?

203
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:01,984
I don't know what you are talking about.

204
00:15:02,067 --> 00:15:03,485
My name is Guccio.

205
00:15:04,403 --> 00:15:07,072
I just don't want to turn into a plant!

206
00:15:08,741 --> 00:15:12,786
Calm down. I said it's fine.

207
00:15:12,870 --> 00:15:16,123
Stand up, Guccio.
Surely you can do that much.

208
00:15:17,666 --> 00:15:19,209
Now hurry it up.

209
00:15:26,175 --> 00:15:27,092
Do you know this?

210
00:15:28,177 --> 00:15:31,889
A human has 12 pairs of ribs,
or 24 bones in total.

211
00:15:31,972 --> 00:15:36,769
Whether a man or a woman, tall or short,
we all have the same number of ribs.

212
00:15:38,729 --> 00:15:40,397
Good. Now go.

213
00:15:44,109 --> 00:15:47,363
I guess he wasn't our enemy after all.

214
00:15:47,446 --> 00:15:49,823
I couldn't care less either way.

215
00:15:50,407 --> 00:15:52,201
I'm only interested

216
00:15:52,284 --> 00:15:56,288
in safely leaving through
the east side of this building.

217
00:15:56,872 --> 00:15:57,831
Isn't that right?

218
00:15:57,915 --> 00:15:59,959
The keyword is "safely."

219
00:16:05,839 --> 00:16:07,174
Let's leave from there.

220
00:16:09,718 --> 00:16:11,637
A green child…

221
00:16:12,680 --> 00:16:17,142
I wasn't told about any of this,

222
00:16:17,851 --> 00:16:20,479
but my job is simple.

223
00:16:20,562 --> 00:16:24,650
Finish off Jolyne Cujoh.
Just that, and nothing more.

224
00:16:24,733 --> 00:16:26,568
I will merely complete my assignment.

225
00:16:31,615 --> 00:16:32,574
Where are they?

226
00:16:32,658 --> 00:16:35,160
Where did Jolyne Cujoh
and her two allies go?

227
00:16:35,786 --> 00:16:38,122
Have they already left the building?

228
00:16:38,205 --> 00:16:42,668
No, they cannot leave without me knowing.

229
00:16:43,502 --> 00:16:45,879
Hey you, what are you doing there?

230
00:16:46,714 --> 00:16:49,049
Hey, I'm talking to you.

231
00:16:49,550 --> 00:16:50,968
Where did those three go?

232
00:16:51,051 --> 00:16:53,470
And how did you manage
to avoid becoming a plant?

233
00:16:59,977 --> 00:17:02,771
Walk… outside…

234
00:17:02,855 --> 00:17:05,566
- Save me…
- How terrible.

235
00:17:05,649 --> 00:17:08,360
Someone restructured his body
into a human trap!

236
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:21,457
Fuck, it hurts!

237
00:17:25,044 --> 00:17:28,213
Mommy, it hurts!

238
00:17:28,297 --> 00:17:30,966
I don't want this shitty arm anymore!

239
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:33,969
I got screwed.

240
00:17:34,053 --> 00:17:37,598
I'm only here
because Pale Snake ordered me

241
00:17:37,681 --> 00:17:40,893
to cause a fight in here
with my Survivor Stand.

242
00:17:41,560 --> 00:17:43,395
But forget that now.

243
00:17:43,479 --> 00:17:46,106
I'm finally outside now.

244
00:17:47,608 --> 00:17:50,360
GUCCIO
STAND NAME: SURVIVOR - BEYOND RECOVERY

245
00:17:54,239 --> 00:17:58,535
Anyway, it looks like we got away
from the other Stand User.

246
00:17:59,745 --> 00:18:03,582
The plants withered away.
I guess it was a temporary bloom.

247
00:18:04,083 --> 00:18:06,919
The problem is that it's about time
for someone from the prison

248
00:18:07,002 --> 00:18:10,047
to realize the abnormalities
going on in the Disciplinary Wing.

249
00:18:10,130 --> 00:18:11,256
That works in our favor.

250
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:16,178
Once that happens,
then Pale Snake will realize it too.

251
00:18:16,261 --> 00:18:17,721
He will appear close to us.

252
00:18:18,347 --> 00:18:21,767
This is the best chance yet of
getting my father's disc back.

253
00:18:25,771 --> 00:18:27,272
Jolyne, watch out!

254
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:38,826
Stone Ocean!

255
00:18:42,996 --> 00:18:44,498
It's an enemy Stand!

256
00:18:44,581 --> 00:18:47,376
He must belong to that
gladiator-looking man!

257
00:18:47,459 --> 00:18:48,752
He swallowed the fruit!

258
00:18:48,836 --> 00:18:50,337
I won't let them have it!

259
00:18:52,381 --> 00:18:53,924
Asshole!

260
00:18:56,593 --> 00:18:57,761
Diver Drive!

261
00:19:02,850 --> 00:19:05,727
What is up with his body?

262
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:08,772
He stinks… really bad!

263
00:19:08,856 --> 00:19:13,026
Go deeper, please!

264
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:16,071
- Shit, my Stand can't enter it!
- Punish me more, please!

265
00:19:16,655 --> 00:19:18,949
I can feel it through my Stand!

266
00:19:19,533 --> 00:19:21,869
My body's starting to stink
from the inside!

267
00:19:22,452 --> 00:19:24,329
Those shoes of yours.

268
00:19:24,413 --> 00:19:28,709
Did my bodily liquid dirty them?
I am very sorry.

269
00:19:30,127 --> 00:19:32,754
Now please, come sit on this chair.

270
00:19:32,838 --> 00:19:36,925
Let me lick your shoes clean.

271
00:19:37,009 --> 00:19:40,721
Would you like this comic book?
I lifted it from the guards' break room.

272
00:19:41,805 --> 00:19:43,098
Careful, there's a bee.

273
00:19:43,724 --> 00:19:47,477
My master is named D an' G.

274
00:19:47,561 --> 00:19:50,230
The last I saw of him,
he was in the Disciplinary Wing.

275
00:19:50,314 --> 00:19:54,318
His right arm got ripped off
and he was crying for his mommy.

276
00:19:59,072 --> 00:20:01,241
It's a remotely controlled Stand!

277
00:20:01,325 --> 00:20:04,328
He wants to take the fruit to his User!

278
00:20:05,495 --> 00:20:07,915
Shit, they've noticed.
The guards are coming!

279
00:20:07,998 --> 00:20:10,626
Jolyne, we must leave for now.

280
00:20:10,709 --> 00:20:12,085
Let's go toward the wetlands.

281
00:20:12,169 --> 00:20:14,755
There must be a water bike
or a boat somewhere close.

282
00:20:19,551 --> 00:20:22,262
This is how to tell wild
strawberries apart.

283
00:20:22,346 --> 00:20:26,225
The ones with yellow flowers
are mock strawberries, so don't eat them.

284
00:20:26,308 --> 00:20:27,976
Shut your annoying trap.

285
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,938
We can't leave this Stand alone.

286
00:20:31,438 --> 00:20:35,192
We need to find a way to get
that green child out of its belly.

287
00:20:35,275 --> 00:20:36,360
I know that.

288
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:39,905
F.F., we have no choice but to take it.

289
00:20:39,988 --> 00:20:43,367
We'll leave you to find its User
and finish him off.

290
00:20:43,450 --> 00:20:44,618
Got it.

291
00:20:45,244 --> 00:20:48,830
Oh, you want me to go with you, Master.

292
00:20:54,711 --> 00:20:59,049
This boat here is built specifically
for the wetlands, Master.

293
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:03,929
It has a propeller engine,
and it uses wind to propel forward.

294
00:21:04,012 --> 00:21:07,057
Shit, how do I start the ignition?

295
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:09,142
Is there a lock somewhere?

296
00:21:09,226 --> 00:21:12,729
It's a throttle lever, Master.

297
00:21:12,813 --> 00:21:16,692
Usually, it must be put
in neutral first, like this.

298
00:21:19,903 --> 00:21:22,155
This stick is for steering.

299
00:21:22,239 --> 00:21:24,574
Push it forward to turn
the empennage to the right,

300
00:21:24,658 --> 00:21:28,036
and pull the stick back
to turn it to the left.

301
00:21:28,120 --> 00:21:30,914
- Release the tether.
- Yes, Master.

302
00:21:37,546 --> 00:21:41,008
Jolyne, do not take your eyes off
that Stand.

303
00:21:47,848 --> 00:21:52,394
While it's in your sight,
it'll act like an obedient servant.

304
00:21:52,477 --> 00:21:54,730
Though creepy,
it will prove useful to you.

305
00:21:54,813 --> 00:21:56,857
But turn your back on it
for a second, and…

306
00:22:04,656 --> 00:22:06,616
Fuck…

307
00:22:07,117 --> 00:22:09,286
Who would have thought that was an attack?

308
00:22:09,369 --> 00:22:11,747
Jolyne, Anastasia…

309
00:22:12,247 --> 00:22:14,750
Don't let it out of your sight!

310
00:23:41,294 --> 00:23:46,299
Subtitle translation by: Megumi Hunter
